        {
          "text": "Lino Josafati wakaakukala mu-Jerusalemu. Nkabela wakali kuya bweendeenda lwabili akati kabantu kuzwa ku-Beereseba akusikila kutulundulundu twa-Efraimu akubaboozya kuli-Jehova Leza wabamawisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
