                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa makani aamusikila, aazwa kubakwanu bakede muminzi yabo, makani aakutila bulowa na makani aamulao na malailile na milazyo na imbeta, muleelede kubaiisya, kuti batabi amulandu kumeso aa-Jehova, kutabi bukali kulindinywe akubakwanu. Amucite obo, lino tamukooyoojana mulandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amubone! Amariya mupaizi mupati ngusilutwe wanu mumakani oonse aa-Jehova, alakwe Zebadiya mwana wa-Ismayeli mweendelezi waluzubo lwa-Juda ngusilutwe wanu mumakani aamwami, Abalo ba-Levi balamugwasya-gwasya, Amubeleke canguzu, Jehova abe abaabo bacita kabotu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
